[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5023413518","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490#issuecomment-5023413518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116490","id":5023413518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK2s1Dg","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T14:31:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T14:31:28Z","body":"Could you rebase this? I would like to review it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5023413518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027129534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490#issuecomment-5027129534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116490","id":5027129534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK6Povg","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-20T20:47:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T20:47:50Z","body":"Rebased.\r\n\r\nMade some changes too.\r\nI made updating the sort editor settings immediately update the sorting instead of just waiting for the next time a document opens.\r\n\r\nThe document list now only updates to match the tab container, to have a more clear separation of responsibilities.\r\nSorting changes the TabContainer order, so the ScriptEditor sorts on its own separate from the document list. It also handles filename disambiguation.\r\nI left connecting to the scene as part of the ScriptEditor too, since it only needs to connect once and I want there to be multiple DocumentLists in the future.\r\nAll tabs now show in the document list, before there was an edge case where EditorHelps that fail to load correctly were just secretly hidden, which can cause issues (like with drag and drop). For example, custom class documentation when the editor is re-opened. This can be addressed in the future to try to get it to actually load, or delete if it otherwise.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5027129534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5039200995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490#issuecomment-5039200995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116490","id":5039200995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLFwa4w","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T21:24:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T22:00:10Z","body":"Rebased after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115998\r\n\r\nI realized `ScriptEditorBase::get_name()` was trying to override the `Node::get_name()`,  so I renamed it.\r\nI also set the ScriptEditorBase name for easier debugging, it was already being done for documentation pages. \r\nThanks to the refactoring of the popup menus, I moved the context menu like I originally had.\r\nThere was an issue where right clicking on documentation showed an error, I fixed it by always passing true for `p_is_context_menu`. Since I was moving the code anyway.\r\n\r\nEdit: I'm going to have to change some things due to how focus changing was changed in the refactor, I need to account for it better for the ShaderEditor.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5039200995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5040680175","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490#issuecomment-5040680175","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116490","id":5040680175,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLHKs7w","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T01:06:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T01:06:48Z","body":"I refactored how the `name_changed` signal gets emitted, to make sure shaders don't take focus when selecting a node like before. \r\nAs a side effect, built in scripts now update their name immediately when the resource name changes, and unsaved status changing also now immediately updates instead of waiting for idle parse.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5040680175/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5070920590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490#issuecomment-5070920590","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116490","id":5070920590,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLkAbjg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-24T14:25:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T14:25:44Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5070920590/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":